    "enUS": {
      "description": "Eh?  Who are you?\n\n{name}?  You're no furbolg.  They are cursed!  They thought I was a bear and captured me, and now they starve me!  My strength is failing...\n\nHelp me escape, then speak with my sister Yama at the Splintertree Post to the east.\n\n{name}! I must escape!",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "Escort Ruul from the Thistlefurs.",
      "summary": "Escort Ruul, then speak with Yama Snowhoof in Splintertree Post.",
      "title": "Freedom to Ruul",
      "translationMetadata": {
